OL,3,GNEWSAWinnie-the-Pooh books to fill
OL,4,Aphone box libraries
OL,5,
OL,6,FFree books for 150 red phone box
OL,7,Flibraries are being made available to
OL,8,Fcelebrate 100 years of two British
OL,9,Flegends - Winnie-the-Pooh and the K2
OL,10,Fred phone box.
OL,12,FThe story's original publisher,
OL,13,FFarshore, said it would donate copies
OL,14,Fof AA Milne's classics - whose setting
OL,15,Fwas inspired by Ashdown Forest in East
OL,16,FSussex - alongside a new authorised
OL,17,Fsequel A Little Boy and His Bear.
OL,23,APub: 06-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
